      {
        "id": 49612,
        "name": "TheJayMann",
        "username": "TheJayMann",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-12-25T05:05:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When I'm playing Ascension with a large amount of people, I tend to ignore what's availbe until it's my turn, because, more than likely, anything out will be gone before my turn comes up.&nbsp; By ignoring it, I don't have to make out plans for what I'll do, only to have to change them 5 times over because someone took the card I was planning for.</p><p>I love the raven card though.&nbsp; It's surprising how often I manage to get it to work well for me.</p>",
