        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-12-27T11:19:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The Raven allows you to name a card, then&nbsp;draw a card.&nbsp; If the card drawn is the same as what you named, then you obtain an honor.&nbsp; In the cases where I hadn't already known my top card, I'm well over 50% correctly guessing the top card.</p>",
